+# Counts and required lines frozen 2026-10-20 from TB source before any run:
+# reports/i3_hp/HP_COUNT_DERIVATION.md. Standalone bench, production transport (M-F1 rev 5), no L2.
+HOP_TB=T+'tb_noc_hop_probes.sv'
